title: "farofa: Failure And Repair simulation Optimization Framework"
abstract: "Monte Carlo simulation of repairable systems (perfect, minimal and imperfect repair, Kijima GRP), fleets with shared maintenance teams, and parameter estimation from failure records, with a local graphical interface."
